<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Interstate Bakeries cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Interstate Bakeries cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Interstate Bakeries Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Interstate Bakeries closed Friday at 54-3/4.</p>
</text>
